  "notes": "FiftyOne's dark charcoal UI uses one hot orange (#ff6d05) for primary actions and slider thumbs. Each sidebar field row has a coloured left stripe matching the colour of its label's overlay on the grid. The image grid packs photos edge to edge in justified rows, with green and blue detection boxes drawn on canvases. The top banner has a diagonal amber hazard-stripe texture. The panel tabs act like a workspace: each tab strip has a + New panel button and an Unsaved state. When I tested the live page it differed from the capture (5 tabs, and the eval panel was already open in detail)."
